OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran 'overwhelmed' by help
OL,4,Aafter arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowie said: "I was overwhelmed by the
OL,7,Famount of people who commented and the
OL,8,Fcompanies that were willing to help
OL,9,Fout."
